# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep host state out of the image:
# a local bin/ or obj/ from a Windows build will happily overwrite the container's and
# produce an image that only works on the machine that built it.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
.git/
.github/

# Not needed to build or run the API.
tests/
ml/
fixtures/
docs/
*.md
docker-compose*.yml

# Never, under any circumstances.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/.snapshots/
**/*.user
